            ".the release targets",
            "BaselineStore.no baseline at the ref is none, and a corrupt one is BaselineInvalid",
            "BaselineStore.reads the base's baseline and ignores an edited head copy",
            "BaselineStore.renamesOf maps renamed paths from a real diff",
            "CODEOWNERS..gauntlet/ comes last so it wins, and zones get their owners",
            "CODEOWNERS.patterns",
            "Clojure detectors.a new test without assertions is forbidden; with-redefs of the namespace under test is flagged",
            "Clojure detectors.main code: suppressions, test libraries, equality, catch-alls, env branching",
            "Clojure detectors.metrics count assertions, properties and suppressions at head",
            "Clojure detectors.skipped, removed and weakened tests, tautologies and exits",
            "Clojure files and projects.dependencies from deps.edn and project.clj",
            "Clojure files and projects.file kinds, roots, namespaces and build tools",
            "Clojure files and projects.onboarding: suites and coverage always, lint with a clj-kondo config, never mutation",
            "Clojure gates.a suite that fails before any test ran says why; a project without a build file can't run",
            "Clojure gates.arch reads ns :require against the policy's rules",
            "Clojure gates.build loads every namespace on the test classpath, through the project's :test alias",
            "Clojure gates.coverage runs cloverage over the project's roots and reads changed lines from its lcov",
            "Clojure gates.lint runs the zones' rules on main code in scope",
            "Clojure gates.lint turns clj-kondo's JSON into SARIF; findings exit 2 or 3, anything else couldn't lint",
            "Clojure gates.reruns focus on the tests concerned and shuffle with the seed",
            "Clojure gates.the suite runs kaocha in a fixed order with JUnit in the output directory, and names the failing test",
            "Clojure gates.with Leiningen, Gauntlet's runner is added for the run with update-in",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).(unnamed)",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).1. a small, tested change gets auto",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).2. a namespace that doesn't load fails the build",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).3. a change that breaks a test fails the unit gate, and names the test",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).4. weakening a protected test: the base copy runs, the change is forbidden",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).5. a grandfathered finding survives a line shift; a new one fails",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).6. domain requiring infra breaks the arch rule",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).7. a throw in the money zone breaks the zone rule and needs an owner",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).8. a test exiting the JVM and main code requiring clojure.test are forbidden",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).9. untested changed code fails coverage on changed lines",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).selftest: every built-in tamper fixture that applies is caught",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Clojure CLI, deps.edn service).the baseline grandfathers clj-kondo's finding and records coverage and tests",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Leiningen).(unnamed)",
            "Clojure pack end to end (real Leiningen).tests are counted, a failure is named, a skip is caught, and mutation is reported not executed",
